### User-Config Service API — REST Client collection
### For VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client) or JetBrains HTTP Client.
### All strategy routes go through api-gateway (/api/v1) and require the JWT + userId/appId/source headers.
###
### Fill these in, then click "Send Request" above each block.
### The appId MUST match the appId claim inside the JWT (loginSource=SSO -> source=WEB).

@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@jwt = PASTE_FRESH_JWT_HERE
@user_id = S4450
@app_id = PASTE_APPID_FROM_JWT
@source = WEB

### After Create, copy the returned strategy_id into here:
@strategy_id = PASTE_STRATEGY_ID_AFTER_CREATE


### 1. CREATE  (WARNING: LIVE + activate_immediately arms a real strategy — use PAPER/false for testing)
POST {{base}}/strategies
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json
userId: {{user_id}}
appId: {{app_id}}
source: {{source}}

{
  "user_id": "{{user_id}}",
  "strategy_name": "My Manthan Test",
  "description": "test strategy",
  "strategy_type": "MANTHAN",
  "trading_mode": "PAPER",
  "activate_immediately": false,
  "trade_config": {
    "total_capital": 500000,
    "stop_loss_pct": 20,
    "trailing_sl_pct": 2
  }
}


### 2. READ ONE  (user_id is a REQUIRED query param, not just the header)
GET {{base}}/strategies/{{strategy_id}}?user_id={{user_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
userId: {{user_id}}
appId: {{app_id}}
source: {{source}}


### 3. LIST  (pagination optional; active_only optional)
GET {{base}}/users/{{user_id}}/strategies?page=1&page_size=20&active_only=false
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
userId: {{user_id}}
appId: {{app_id}}
source: {{source}}


### 4. UPDATE  (version must match current; increments on success; wrong version -> 412)
PUT {{base}}/strategies/{{strategy_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json
userId: {{user_id}}
appId: {{app_id}}
source: {{source}}

{
  "strategy_name": "Renamed Manthan",
  "version": 1
}


### 5. ACTIVATE
POST {{base}}/strategies/{{strategy_id}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
userId: {{user_id}}
appId: {{app_id}}
source: {{source}}


### 6. DEACTIVATE  (KEEP_POSITIONS_OPEN is safe; SQUARE_OFF_AT_MARKET places REAL exits)
POST {{base}}/strategies/{{strategy_id}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json
userId: {{user_id}}
appId: {{app_id}}
source: {{source}}

{
  "position_handling": "KEEP_POSITIONS_OPEN"
}


### 7. DELETE  (soft STOP: sets stopped_at, row STAYS GET-able as history -> a later Read returns 200 not 404)
DELETE {{base}}/strategies/{{strategy_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
userId: {{user_id}}
appId: {{app_id}}
source: {{source}}


### 8. UPDATE BROKER CREDENTIALS  (encrypts + upserts execution_db.user_credentials, publishes USER_CREDENTIALS_UPDATED)
POST {{base}}/auth/credentials
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json
userId: {{user_id}}
appId: {{app_id}}
source: {{source}}

{
  "user_id": "{{user_id}}",
  "bearer_token": "{{jwt}}"
}


### ─────────────── NEGATIVE TESTS (prove error-code mapping) ───────────────

### N1. Empty name -> 400 INVALID_ARGUMENT
POST {{base}}/strategies
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json
userId: {{user_id}}
appId: {{app_id}}
source: {{source}}

{ "user_id": "{{user_id}}", "strategy_name": "", "strategy_type": "MANTHAN", "trade_config": { "total_capital": 500000 } }


### N2. Under-capital (<5L) -> 400
POST {{base}}/strategies
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json
userId: {{user_id}}
appId: {{app_id}}
source: {{source}}

{ "user_id": "{{user_id}}", "strategy_name": "LowCap", "strategy_type": "MANTHAN", "trade_config": { "total_capital": 100000 } }


### N3. Stale version -> 412 FAILED_PRECONDITION
PUT {{base}}/strategies/{{strategy_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json
userId: {{user_id}}
appId: {{app_id}}
source: {{source}}

{ "strategy_name": "X", "version": 999 }


### N4. Non-existent id -> 404 NOT_FOUND  (use a VALID non-nil UUID; the all-zeros UUID is a 400, not 404)
PUT {{base}}/strategies/11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json
userId: {{user_id}}
appId: {{app_id}}
source: {{source}}

{ "strategy_name": "X", "version": 1 }


### N5. IDOR (body user_id != header userId) -> 403 FORBIDDEN
POST {{base}}/strategies
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json
userId: {{user_id}}
appId: {{app_id}}
source: {{source}}

{ "user_id": "SOMEONE_ELSE", "strategy_name": "Hack", "strategy_type": "MANTHAN", "trade_config": { "total_capital": 500000 } }
